# The Fogworks (CIPlay the_fogworks): the plan The Rainmakers' fourth island, quest "The Fog Shift"
# The bay (floor -2.5 m) on the south side: the street boardwalk x -36..36 z -46.5..-43.5 (deck 2 m), the dock x -1.5..1.5
# z -72..-46.5, a path north to the yard cut through the bank; halls on the yard at z -14..-9.5: the pump hall x -32..-26, the control
# room -12..-7.5, the condenser 6..12, the boiler house 24..30; the towers at x -30 / 30, z -62, the watch mast -30 -55.5.
island The Fogworks
offset -0.0582 13.6067
expect step 0
expect title The Fog Shift
wait 5
expect hidden controlsafe
zone town_dock
expect step 1
read Fogworks bulletin
expect step 2
zone pump_hall
expect step 3
use fogwire
expect message not set as the bulletin says
use valveA
use valveB
use fogwire
expect message not set as the bulletin says
use valveB
use valveC
use fogwire
expect story foglines 1
expect step 4
read Shift chief's notes
expect step 5
zone condenser
wait 2
kill Rat
expect step 6
code safekeypad 1111 wrong
code safekeypad 3157
expect shown controlsafe
open Control room safe
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_EngineControls 1
expect step 8
zone tower_top
expect step 9
open Tower cabin chest
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_MetalDetector 1
expect step 11
open Founders' Day crate
expect message NOT TO BE OPENED
use fogradio
expect story confession 1
expect step 12
open Founders' Day crate
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Firework 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineTool 1
expect item Blueprint_BatteryCharger 1
expect story boilerkey 1
expect step 17
# RAIN 10-26: the hub, Hanne Vik, the climb, Condensate Cave, the secrets
expect hidden fw_rewchest
use fw_machine
expect hidden fw_rewchest
read Night shift notice
expect step 18
use Hanne Vik
wait 1
expect step 19
expect hidden fw_lampchest
use Shift lamp 1
use Shift lamp 2
use Shift lamp 3
wait 1
expect shown fw_lampchest
open Hanne's shift box
zone fw_trail
expect step 20
zone fw_summit
expect step 21
open Fog lookout deck box
wait 3
expect story fw_top 1
expect step 22
zone fw_cave
expect step 23
open Condensate Cave chest
wait 3
expect story fw_cave 1
expect step 24
use fw_machine
expect shown fw_rewchest
expect story fw_fixed 1
open Fog horn reward
wait 3
read Fog horn tape
expect step 25
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the set
zone fw_plane
open Supply plane's crate
read Supply pilot's note
zone fw_jumps
open Stack perch
open Stack top
expect hidden fw_setchest
use fw_piece1
use fw_piece2
use fw_piece3
use fw_piece4
use fw_piece5
wait 2
expect shown fw_setchest
open Shift chest
open Boilerman's locker
expect message padlocked
use mattiscage
expect survivor rainmakers_mattis
expect story boilerkey 0
open Boilerman's locker
expect item MetalIngot 4
expect done
